    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-36" id="fn-36" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP owns 100% of Tallgrass MLP Operations, LLC, which owns 100% of Trailblazer Pipeline Company LLC. All percentages as of December 31, 2025.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-37" id="fn-37" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">As approved in Docket No. CP22-468, on September 30, 2024, Trailblazer abandoned 324 miles of pipeline, associated interconnects, and three compressor stations.&#160; Additionally, Trailblazer abandoned the remaining additional 68 miles of pipeline on December 24, 2024.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-38" id="fn-38" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Miscellaneous Paid-in Capital.</link:footnote>
