    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-41" id="fn-41" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fuel recovery volumes (shipper supplied gas for transmission): 69,475 dth</link:footnote>
