    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-47" id="fn-47" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Many of the natural gas volumes required to be reported on this page are tracked at the entity level, rather than by service type (i.e. firm transport, interruptible transport, etc.) or by discounted, negotiated, or recourse rate contracts and, therefore, the amounts reported have been allocated to the service types and to discounted, negotiated or recourse rate contracts based on reasonable assumptions.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-48" id="fn-48" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">As of August 11, 2024&#160; - REX leases to Trailblazer existing capacity sufficient to transport 902,000 Dth/d from the REX/Trailblazer Lone Tree receipt point to the East Cheyenne Gas Storage point; existing capacity sufficient to transport 827,000 Dth/d from the East Cheyenne Gas Storage point to the Trailblazer East Saline delivery point; and all capacity on the new facilities.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-49" id="fn-49" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Excludes fuel.</link:footnote>
