    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-53" id="fn-53" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Tallgrass Energy Partners, LP is the source entity for the capital structure.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-54" id="fn-54" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Fixed asset method is used for gas stored (lines 1 through 6).</link:footnote>
