    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-60" id="fn-60" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Transferred to Account No. 211, Additional Paid in Capital</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-61" id="fn-61" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">In accordance with the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act signed into law on December 22, 2017, Trailblazer remeasured its accumulated deferred income taxes (Accounts 190 and 282) during the year ended December 31, 2017 based on the new tax rates, resulting in a decrease in the net deferred tax liability. The adjustment to Trailblazer's accumulated deferred income taxes was recorded in Account 254. The balance is amortized to Account 410.1, Provision of Deferred Income Taxes, over the estimated remaining useful life of the pipeline.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-62" id="fn-62" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to Trailblazer&#8217;s tariff fuel/power tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-63" id="fn-63" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to Trailblazer&#8217;s tariff fuel/power tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-64" id="fn-64" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Shipper Refunds pursuant to the Tariff Revenue Crediting Mechanism.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-65" id="fn-65" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes Park and Loan Service revenues of $30,762</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-66" id="fn-66" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Includes Backhaul revenues of $2,067,546</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-67" id="fn-67" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The electric power cost used in compressor station operations was $12,754,456</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-68" id="fn-68" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The electric power cost used in compressor station operations was $4,549,272</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-69" id="fn-69" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Information provided represents general ledger dollar amounts and production month volumes.</link:footnote>
