    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-76" id="fn-76" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged by Tallgrass Interstate Gas Transmission, LLC for firm transportation services, excluding fuel and power.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-77" id="fn-77" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">As of August 11, 2024&#160; - REX leases to Trailblazer existing capacity sufficient to transport 902,000 Dth/d from the REX/Trailblazer Lone Tree receipt point to the East Cheyenne Gas Storage point; existing capacity sufficient to transport 827,000 Dth/d from the East Cheyenne Gas Storage point to the Trailblazer East Saline delivery point; and all capacity on the new facilities.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-78" id="fn-78" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for firm transportation costs, net of fuel and power.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-79" id="fn-79" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for firm transportation costs, net of fuel and power.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-80" id="fn-80" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Amounts charged are for firm transportation costs, net of fuel and power.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-81" id="fn-81" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">All horsepower is site rated based on elevation.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-82" id="fn-82" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Gas for blow downs, start ups, and purges was 7,734 Dth</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-83" id="fn-83" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Stations 601, 602, and 603 were abandoned on September 30, 2004 as approved in Docket CP22-468</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-84" id="fn-84" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Single-day peak delivery was 5/6/2025</link:footnote>
